<div class="about">

<div style="text-align:center;"><span id="hover">

<a href="https://paisleyandsparrow.com/meet-minneapolis-blogger-jen-biswas"><img id="about-photo" src="https://paisleyandsparrow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/jen-headshot.jpg" alt="About Me" /></a></span>

<div id="about">


</div></div>
<h3>Hello, I'm Jen!</h3>
<p>
I'm a crazy plant lady and mom of 3 who loves cookie dough, removable wallpaper + <a href="https://paisleyandsparrow.com/balloon-garland">balloon garlands</a>. </p>
		<p>This blog is a place to help you find joy in your life, style + home. I'm glad you're here!
</p>

